+# Tree-sitter grammars
+
+The MVP binary compiles the following Tree-sitter grammars into the symbol graph.
+
+| Language | Crate | File extensions |
+|---|---|---|
+| Rust | `tree-sitter-rust` | `.rs` |
+| TypeScript / TSX | `tree-sitter-typescript` | `.ts`, `.tsx` |
+| JavaScript / JSX | `tree-sitter-javascript` | `.js`, `.jsx` |
+| Python | `tree-sitter-python` | `.py` |
+| Go | `tree-sitter-go` | `.go` |
+
+The MVP language set comes from the symbol-graph scope in the repository design
+documents. The crate names are the corresponding Tree-sitter Rust grammar crates.
